WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-04 - Unplugged
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Our Own Frequency (2008)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.115
[Instrumental Intro — Mellow Acoustic Guitar & Soft Atmospheric Synth]

00:00:13.115 --> 00:00:16.500
Pull the cords out of the wall

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Let the heavy feedback fall

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.525
I don't want to hear the overdrive

00:00:23.525 --> 00:00:27.889
I just want to feel like we're alive

00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:33.500
Just the wood, the wire, and the hollow sound

00:00:33.554 --> 00:00:37.978
Before they tried to run us to the ground

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:47.602
Take the master tapes and let them burn

00:00:47.702 --> 00:00:54.344
There's a different kind of truth we have to learn

00:00:54.504 --> 00:00:58.465
No electric pulse to hide the pain

00:00:58.585 --> 00:01:03.026
No screaming crowds out in the rain

00:01:03.126 --> 00:01:06.800
Just a quiet hum and a steady breath

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:11.000
Walking on the edge of life and death

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.500
We are unplugged, we are shutting down the grid

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:21.712
Hiding in the shadows where we always hid

00:01:22.592 --> 00:01:26.400
Strip away the heavy metal, cut the power line

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:31.053
Leave the crazy circus far behind

00:01:31.113 --> 00:01:35.534
When the amps go cold and the stage is bare

00:01:35.594 --> 00:01:49.307
I look across the room, and you're still there

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:58.800
It takes a lot of nerve to just be still

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:05.642
To stop the endless climbing of the hill

00:02:05.742 --> 00:02:11.500
But in this quiet room, I find my grace

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:18.000
You're the only anchor in this place

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:23.500
We are unplugged, we are shutting down the grid

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:30.000
Hiding in the shadows where we always hid

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
Strip away the heavy metal, cut the power line

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:39.000
Leave the crazy circus far behind

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.982
When the amps go cold and the stage is bare

00:02:42.982 --> 00:02:46.965
I look across the room, and you're still there

00:02:49.246 --> 00:02:53.500
Just the wood and the wire...

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.500
Unplugged.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:16.000
[Outro — Soft Lingering Synth Chord]
